#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/recv.2:194
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "I<ee_errno> contains the I<errno> number of the queued error.  "
#| "I<ee_origin> is the origin code of where the error originated.  The other "
#| "fields are protocol-specific.  The macro B<SOCK_EE_OFFENDER> returns a "
#| "pointer to the address of the network object where the error originated "
#| "from given a pointer to the ancillary message.  If this address is not "
