#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2426 build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2470
#: build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2725
msgid ""
"This helper is available only if the kernel was compiled with B<CONFIG_NET> "
"configuration option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2432 build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2476
#: build/C/man7/bpf-helpers.7:2731
